OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1795529937
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 8 Dec to Tue 22 DecFThe
OL,6,Ftrack of low pressure systems will
OL,7,Flikely be further south than normal
OL,8,Fduring this period. This means that
OL,9,Frainfall and any windy conditions will
OL,10,Fprobably be focused across the south
OL,11,Fof the UK; conversely, higher pressure
OL,12,Fcloser to the north means drier and
OL,13,Fmore settled weather is more likely
OL,14,Fhere. Temperatures in the south will
OL,15,Fprobably be near normal or perhaps
OL,16,Fslightly above at times, with the
OL,17,Fnorth colder than normal, although
OL,18,Feither bias could extend to cover a
OL,19,Fwider area of the UK.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
